  "title": "The Induced Abelian Cayley Embedding Number of P3 x P4 Is 19",
  "batch_label": "52",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For the 12-vertex rectangular grid G=P_3 square P_4 and induced Abelian Cayley embedding exactly as defined in problem.md, eta(G)=19. Explicitly, f(i,j)=-i-4j modulo 19 embeds G as an induced subgraph of Cay(Z_19,{+-1,+-4}), and no finite Abelian group of order at most 18 admits such an embedding.",
